1
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:05,850
Three rules at my stall.

2
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:07,701
One. Pay first.

3
00:00:07,981 --> 00:00:09,784
Two. Hands off the tray.

4
00:00:10,064 --> 00:00:11,743
Three. Breakers get the stick.

5
00:00:12,393 --> 00:00:13,283
Quiet so far.

6
00:00:18,143 --> 00:00:19,018
Iced tea, please.

7
00:00:19,298 --> 00:00:19,827
Pay first.

8
00:00:20,393 --> 00:00:20,927
Here you go.

9
00:00:23,193 --> 00:00:23,951
One iced tea.

10
00:00:24,231 --> 00:00:25,146
Thanks. Good night.

11
00:00:27,193 --> 00:00:28,723
Normal customers. I love them.

12
00:00:32,543 --> 00:00:33,504
Free skewers? HONK!

13
00:00:33,784 --> 00:00:34,314
Pay first.

14
00:00:34,864 --> 00:00:35,843
The tray. HONK.

15
00:00:36,123 --> 00:00:37,255
Rule two! Hands OFF!

16
00:00:41,464 --> 00:00:42,242
Rule three.

17
00:00:43,892 --> 00:00:44,208
Got it.

18
00:00:45,192 --> 00:00:45,618
Rule three!

19
00:00:48,192 --> 00:00:48,450
...Honk.

20
00:00:52,342 --> 00:00:52,648
THIRTY.

21
00:00:52,928 --> 00:00:53,654
Pay first, sir.

22
00:00:54,392 --> 00:00:55,561
I SAID. THIRTY.

23
00:00:55,841 --> 00:00:57,746
Sir, a window is not a door!

24
00:00:58,296 --> 00:01:01,160
Sir. You're stuck.

25
00:01:01,710 --> 00:01:02,416
Rule one.

26
00:01:02,696 --> 00:01:03,179
...Thirty?

27
00:01:05,310 --> 00:01:06,546
Fifteen bucks. Paid.

28
00:01:06,826 --> 00:01:07,421
Thank you, sir.

29
00:01:09,310 --> 00:01:10,516
Why are there FOUR of them?!

30
00:01:12,910 --> 00:01:13,688
Rule three.

31
00:01:16,310 --> 00:01:16,965
...It's broken.

32
00:01:19,510 --> 00:01:21,379
Okay. Okay okay okay.

33
00:01:23,010 --> 00:01:23,860
Close it! Close it!

34
00:01:26,110 --> 00:01:26,833
Don't open it.

35
00:01:30,710 --> 00:01:31,986
They're still out there.

36
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:37,190
See you tomorrow.

37
00:01:38,910 --> 00:01:40,063
...He's gone. Goodnight.

38
00:01:42,310 --> 00:01:44,694
Night three. Some things you don't fight.
